{title: Tum Aaye To ( Aur Kya )}
{artist: Abhijeet Jatin Lalit Phir Bhi Dil Hai Hindustani}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#] [D#] [F],        Tum aaye to hawao mein ek nasha hai
[A#] [D#] [Cm],        Tum aaye to fijao mein rang sa hai
[F] [Cm] [F],        Yeh rang saare hai bas tumhaare
[A#] [F] [A#],        Aur kya, aur kya, aur kya
[D#] [A#] [D#] [A#],        Tum aaye ho toh yeh dekh lo,
[D#] [F] [A#],        naya naya sa lage yeh jaha ho
[F] [A#],        Haan haan haan haan haan oh ho
[D#] [A#] [D#] [A#],        Hansi hansi hai yeh jamin,
[D#] [F] [A#],        dhula dhula sa hai yeh aasmaan
[A#] [F],        Tum ho to hai yeh sama
[A#] [F] [A#],        Aur kya, aur kya, aur kya
[D#] [A#] [D#] [A#],        Dhadak raha hai dil mera,
[D#] [F] [A#],        jhuki jhuki hai palke yaha ho
[F] [A#],        Haan haan haan haan haan oh ho
[D#] [A#] [D#] [A#],        Jo dil mein ho woh kah bhi do,
[D#] [F] [A#],        ruki ruki si hai yeh daastan
[A#] [F],        Jasbat maange jaban
[A#] [F] [A#],        Aur kya, aur kya, aur kya, aur kya
